Unfortunately, we have chosen the “wrong” direction for our arrow here. In Definitions <a href="/tag/023V" data-tag="023V">35.34.1</a> and <a href="/tag/023W" data-tag="023W">35.34.3</a> we should have the opposite direction to what was done in Definition <a href="/tag/023B" data-tag="023B">35.2.1</a> by the general principle that “functions” and “spaces” are dual.